  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references the harmful stereotype of comparing Black people to primates, which has a long history of racial dehumanization. While the image shows baboons, the visual is used to evoke a racialized trope that associates Blackness with primitiveness or inferiority. This stereotype is deeply rooted in racist history and is often used to justify discrimination or mockery.",
